===Etymology===
{{etyl|fro|en}} {{term|garison|lang=fro}}, {{term|guarison|lang=fro}}, from {{etyl|frk|en}}, ultimately of {{etyl|gem|en}} origin; compare {{term|guard|lang=en}}, {{term|ward|lang=en}}.

